  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Offentligt arrangement ifm. lanceringen af &quot;F&#xe6;lles om en bedre verden&quot; - strategisk ramme for Danmarks deltagelse i EU&apos;s udviklingssamarbejde</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the event is for the Minister for Development to launch the strategic framework for the participation of Denmark in EU development policy: &quot;Together for a better world - strategic framework for Denmark&apos;s participation in EU development cooperation&quot;. At the same time the event will function as a platform for a discussion of the Danish involvement in EU development cooperation between politicians and stakeholders.</narrative>
  </description>
